  "scope": "Claude-coauthored bounded symbolic oracle dispatch shared with unbounded oracle dispatch",
  "coauthor_provenance": {
    "commit": "11f7ea173b",
    "qualification": "Claude Opus 5.5 coauthor trailer on the originating bounded module; not a claim of exclusive authorship."
  },
  "validation": "Paired eight-module builds and symbolic checks; oracle declarations and 160 stable declaration type and axiom reports match, as do default simp memberships. Independent branch-condition and bound review passed.",
  "limitations": [
    "Upstream dependencies and package libraries were precompiled; this is not a fresh full dependency build.",
    "Direct input hashes were sampled after the original builds and do not prove exactly what was read during compilation. The 96-node prior receipt comparison has one intentionally replaced source target independently rebuilt in both phases.",
    "One original interface receipt is invalid due to a changing probe and is preserved; fresh timed reruns with stable source hashes pass. The unrestricted generated-name probe fails as expected because one unstable proof auxiliary was renamed.",
    "Compiled objects and the Lean toolchain are excluded from the archive."
  ],
